# Only what a player needs to RUN a mod is published.
#
# Design notes, research and the offline test harness stay on the local machine — they are
# not requirements for using the mod, and the harness vendors data from Realistic Livestock
# that is not ours to redistribute.

# --- design and working notes -------------------------------------------------
# Every .md is local by default. LICENSE has no extension so it is unaffected;
# README.md is force-added below because it tells a downloader what they need.
*.md
!README.md

# --- development tooling ------------------------------------------------------
# The offline harness. Also holds a copy of Realistic Livestock's xml/ for testing,
# which must never be published — RL is GPLv3 and belongs to its own authors.
test/
scratchpad/

# --- source assets ------------------------------------------------------------
# Working files for the icons. The built .dds ship; their sources do not.
_source_icon.png
*.xcf
*.psd

# --- build output and local clutter -------------------------------------------
*.zip
graphify-out/
graphify-merged/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
